              "content": "Harness 工程：与 Agent 协作的工程方法",
              "lineHeight": 1.3,
              "fontFamily": "$font-serif",
              "fontSize": 42,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "W41LeR",
              "name": "摘要",
              "fill": "$text-muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "当编码不再是瓶颈，工程师的价值开始向方法、判断与系统设计迁移。这篇文章梳理我在 Agent 优先时代的工程实践。",
              "lineHeight": 1.8,
              "fontFamily": "$font-serif",
              "fontSize": 18,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "HlfIQ",
